OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a mostly cloudy day
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of mostly light rain.
OL,7,FStill some good dry spells and perhaps
OL,8,Fsome brighter intervals breaking
OL,9,Fthrough in the afternoon. Breezy in
OL,10,Fthe west.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy start with light rain
OL,13,Fpossible, turning drier with some
OL,14,Fclear intervals developing through the
OL,15,Fevening. Some clear intervals
OL,16,Fovernight, although a few heavier
OL,17,Fshowers will spread eastwards. Rather
OL,18,Fcold.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
